{
  "name": "@cycspring/dsh-fathom",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Fathom Search tools for DeepSeek Harness: multi-engine web/vertical search, image search, page extraction and quota checks through fathomsearch.xyz, with key rotation and failover. The built-in web_search is never replaced. | DeepSeek Harness 的 Fathom Search 工具：多引擎网页/垂直搜索、图片搜索、正文提取与额度查询，支持多 Key 轮换与故障转移；内置 web_search 永不替换。",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib/lib.js",
    "lib/tools.js",
    "lib/schema.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/en.json",
    "locale/zh.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "CycSpring",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/CycSpring/dsh-fathom.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/CycSpring/dsh-fathom/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/CycSpring/dsh-fathom#readme",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "fathom",
    "web-search",
    "tool"
  ]
}
